{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Loftia, a cozy, multiplayer world where you can build towards a brighter, more sustainable future! Connect with friends both old and new, to farm, craft, explore, decorate, and create a meaningful impact - together. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the world of Loftia, you can:<strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/1df1a413775cec2769d5e3bcf64d2046.avif?t=1748918451\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras_big/1df1a413775cec2769d5e3bcf64d2046.avif?t=1748918451 width=800 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together with others to build a brighter and more sustainable world, by contributing to community projects. Unlock new resources, uncover hidden stories, and discover exciting new islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/ddffc462197e7ceae1771abd7c2a5e4f.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/ddffc462197e7ceae1771abd7c2a5e4f.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/1c0d6c85858dfc546778ef4301720547.avif?t=1748918451\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras_big/1c0d6c85858dfc546778ef4301720547.avif?t=1748918451 width=800 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your own personal floating island and join up with others to form neighborhoods. Decorate, farm, craft and party together!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/50447618ef53ed39b09042d7158527fc.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/50447618ef53ed39b09042d7158527fc.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/06337d6199cd4c0597fc55361f0a04fd.avif?t=1748918451\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras_big/06337d6199cd4c0597fc55361f0a04fd.avif?t=1748918451 width=800 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From scavenging in deserted factories to venturing through sky islands, you can work together with friends to tackle group content, and solve challenging puzzles across new biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/5cd74e1d2da47052961de78534165850.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/5cd74e1d2da47052961de78534165850.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/23d9dd845c8e57d619e34362cc6b5cec.avif?t=1748918451\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras_big/23d9dd845c8e57d619e34362cc6b5cec.avif?t=1748918451 width=800 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repurpose discarded materials into valued equipment through an innovative new crafting system, whether it\u2019s upcycling an old tire into a flower planter or crafting unique furniture from reclaimed wood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/12426b351b265327b4e25d9891def6f6.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/12426b351b265327b4e25d9891def6f6.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/48e91c7e9fc38365c326a1e3f1c649d2.avif?t=1748918451\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras_big/48e91c7e9fc38365c326a1e3f1c649d2.avif?t=1748918451 width=800 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master sustainable farming techniques like hydroponics, aquaponics, and trellis farming. Craft your own tools using renewable energy generated from the sun, wind and rain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/8948e51e094b25fd3c2b50e1c6f2a180.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/8948e51e094b25fd3c2b50e1c6f2a180.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/d6947976b1a775a7ccbe7d1e5e2504bd.avif?t=1748918451\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras_big/d6947976b1a775a7ccbe7d1e5e2504bd.avif?t=1748918451 width=800 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character that reflects your own personal style and design your home in your favorite aesthetic\u2014whether it\u2019s Y2K, Goth, or something uniquely yours. Add a personal touch by crafting organic paints and dyes to color your items just the way you like!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/4cb1e87f1d2875e8c0ea0808c3e304ab.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/4cb1e87f1d2875e8c0ea0808c3e304ab.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/be1726f79a69d95bcf195544a99ccaad.avif?t=1748918451\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras_big/be1726f79a69d95bcf195544a99ccaad.avif?t=1748918451 width=800 height=203 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue and adopt animals to join you on your journey\u2014from capybaras and turtles, to endangered species and more. You\u2019ll even be able to dress them up in cute outfits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/d65419cc50f382872e1b121b457d0ead.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/d65419cc50f382872e1b121b457d0ead.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/2c14ff6abbddaef1ad9bbf13cf930e2a.avif?t=1748918451\" width=616 height=157 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re exploring, building, or simply unwinding with friends, Loftia offers countless opportunities for fun, creativity, and meaningful connections for everyone.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/11fd8be18d834bd90f84ceff3f620bc2.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/11fd8be18d834bd90f84ceff3f620bc2.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2320980?t=1748918451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2320980?t=1748918451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/6ff52a8a7a58aa161b11b838cb6f14abcb68f620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748918451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/6ff52a8a7a58aa161b11b838cb6f14abcb68f620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748918451","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descrip