her!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/50447618ef53ed39b09042d7158527fc.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/50447618ef53ed39b09042d7158527fc.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/06337d6199cd4c0597fc55361f0a04fd.avif?t=1748918451\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras_big/06337d6199cd4c0597fc55361f0a04fd.avif?t=1748918451 width=800 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From scavenging in deserted factories to venturing through sky islands, you can work together with friends to tackle group content, and solve challenging puzzles across new biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/5cd74e1d2da47052961de78534165850.poster.avif?t=1748918451\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/5cd74e1d2da47052961de78534165850.webm?t=1748918451\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras/23d9dd845c8e57d619e34362cc6b5cec.avif?t=1748918451\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2320980/extras_big/23d9dd845c8e57d619e34362cc6b5cec.avif?t=1748918451 width=800 height=203 /></span><